mi>a</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow></mover><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />In reaction (iii) <math><mi>N</mi><msub><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is evolved whereas in reaction 1, 2 and 4 <math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is evolved."
